# Milestone 2 (X3): AI commit message generation and the AI settings page. A fake provider on a loopback port streams
# a canned message, an in-memory key store stands in for the keychain and nothing leaves the machine. Compare with
# 21 section 5.3 (commit box) and 5.4 (Settings > AI).
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
ai use fake provider 100
open repository linear
wait idle
ai prepare staged changes
wait idle
shot x3-01-commit-box-generate
ai set message wip: sign-up form
ai generate
wait 1500
shot x3-02-streaming-stop
wait idle
shot x3-03-generated
open settings page ai
wait idle
shot x3-04-settings-ready
ai test connection
wait idle
shot x3-05-settings-test-ok
close dialog
ai use hosted provider
open settings page ai
wait idle
shot x3-06-settings-hosted-key-stored
close dialog
ai set message
ai generate
wait idle
shot x3-07-privacy-consent
close dialog
ai reset
open settings page ai
wait idle
shot x3-08-settings-not-configured
close dialog
assert no error
